-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ONNX Runtime (used, not redistributed)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RB Stems Plus does not ship ONNX Runtime. The Stems Cache bridge and the
prepare helper load the copy of ONNX Runtime 1.18 that comes with rekordbox,
copied from rekordbox on the user's own Mac. The prepare helper also decodes
MP3 files with the libmpg123 inside rekordbox, where rekordbox keeps it. ONNX
Runtime is Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation, MIT License,
https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime.

No file made by AlphaTheta or Pioneer DJ is distributed with RB Stems Plus.
Pioneer's files are only copied on the user's own Mac, so that uninstalling
Stems Cache can put rekordbox back exactly as it was.

